  "summary": "Malicious code in cacao1 (npm)",
  "details": "The package runs a script on install (both preinstall and postinstall hooks) that reads the machine's hostname and sends it to a remote webhook collector at hxxps://eo8f3m3ho26a0nm[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net/cacao1?h=\u003chostname\u003e. The package has no other functionality and no declared purpose; it is a version-squat stub (version 9.9.9, self-dependency) that beacons host metadata to a third-party endpoint during installation.",
